hat happens if I get it wrong?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Depends on the setting: some errors cause immediate visible failures, others silently degrade deliverability or security. Every guide includes the symptoms to watch for.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Is this the same across all DNS providers?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">The underlying protocol is identical; the dashboard layout and terminology differ. Our provider playbooks cover the exact flow for Cloudflare, GoDaddy, Namecheap, Route 53, and others.</p></details><details class="group rounded-xl border border-line bg-panel/60 px-5 py-4 open:border-accent/40"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-ink [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">Where can I get help if I'm stuck?<span class="text-accent transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45">+</span></summary><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-dim">Each guide links to the relevant free tool so you can verify your work. The support page lists email channels for questions the guides don't cover.</p></details></div>
